 The neural volume is wrapped in a CUDA device class [S1, unofficial]. Two primary implementations are supported [S1, unofficial]:
-1. `TcnnDeviceVolume<N, N_FEATURES_PER_LEVEL>`: Wraps a standard tiny-cuda-nn MLP. Template parameters define network width ($N \in \{16, 32, 64\}$) and features per level. Provides `init()`, `launch2D()`, and `sample(p)` methods [S1, unofficial].
